-growth","title":"Bank Credit Growth"},{"slug":"capacity-utilisation","title":"Capacity Utilisation"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"domestic-passenger-car-sales","title":"Domestic Passenger Car Sales"},{"slug":"domestic-tractor-sales","title":"Domestic Tractor Sales"},{"slug":"energy-requirements","title":"Energy Requirements"},{"slug":"essential-commodity-prices","title":"Essential Commodity Prices"},{"slug":"goods-and-services-tax-gst-collections","title":"GST Collections"},{"slug":"money-supply-m3","title":"Money Supply (M3)"},{"slug":"natural-gas-production","title":"Natural Gas Production"},{"slug":"non-oil-exports","title":"Non-Oil Exports"},{"slug":"petroleum-consumption","title":"Petroleum Consumption"},{"slug":"private-consumption-pfce","title":"Private Consumption (PFCE)"},{"slug":"revenue-earnings-railway-freight-traffic-major-commodities","title":"Railway Freight Traffic- Revenue"},{"slug":"steel-consumption","title":"Steel Consumption"},{"slug":"steel-production","title":"Steel Production"},{"slug":"two-wheeler-sales","title":"Domestic Two-Wheeler Sales"}],"title":"Cement Production","description":"India's cement production stands at 47.5 Million Tonnes for Mar 2026. Cement demand is closely tied to construction and infrastructure spending.","headline":{"Absolute":"India's cement production stands at 47.5 Million Tonnes for Mar 2026. Cement demand is closely tied to construction and infrastructure spending.","Y-o-Y":"India's cement production stands at 3.83% for Mar 2026. Cement demand is closely tied to construction and infrastructure spending."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-03-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T15:27:49+00:00"}